      "locked": false,
      "text": "Split\nA splitter splits up first message into a\nformatted set of \"thoughts\" to cover, as\nnew stream entries with citations in the\norigin stream as new stream messages.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "1fcosqaCEjDrx8H8eXKRG",
      "originalText": "Split\nA splitter splits up first message into a formatted set of \"thoughts\" to cover, as new stream entries with citations in the origin stream as new stream messages.",
