      "updated": 1789090730447,
      "created": 1789087849510,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Split:\nfor dividing info up into distinct\ntrains of thought.\n\nRepeating process:\nBig message in scratchpad\nProcess for pulling thought from\nmessage, slotting, and and implied\nqueuing of its next instance up.\n\nMechanical process creates streams\nfrom final format. Failure triggers\nretry.\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "DpdnGluBZ7FzCNOJzFVzo",
      "originalText": "Split:\nfor dividing info up into distinct trains of thought.\n\nRepeating process:\nBig message in scratchpad\nProcess for pulling thought from message, slotting, and and implied queuing of its next instance up.\n\nMechanical process creates streams from final format. Failure triggers retry.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
